      <title>The Dev Tools Expert</title>
      <link>https://gautamz07.github.io/peckingatcode-alpha/posts/the-dev-tools-expert/</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 03 Feb 2026 16:46:50 +0530</pubDate>
      <guid>https://gautamz07.github.io/peckingatcode-alpha/posts/the-dev-tools-expert/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;In this overly simplistic we&amp;rsquo;re going to add 2 simple alias for a couple of common git log options.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Firstly (keep in mind we use the &lt;code&gt;--graph&lt;/code&gt; option below because the output is slightly more clear then just a plan &lt;code&gt;git log&lt;/code&gt;),&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; style=&#34;color:#f8f8f2;background-color:#272822;-moz-tab-size:4;-o-tab-size:4;tab-size:4;&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-javascript&#34; data-lang=&#34;javascript&#34;&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;git&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;log&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;--&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;graph&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;// instead of typing out this command, lets add an alias
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;git&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;config&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#f92672&#34;&gt;--&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;global&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;alias&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;lg&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#e6db74&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;log --graph&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#75715e&#34;&gt;// Now you can use the command like so
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;display:flex;&#34;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;git&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&#34;color:#a6e22e&#34;&gt;lg&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;git lg or git log &amp;ndash;graph&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#34;https://gautamz07.github.io/peckingatcode-alpha/posts/the-dev-tools-expert/jomo.png&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
