      <title>Git alias for git log and git oneline</title>
      <link>https://gautamz07.github.io/peckingatcode-alpha/posts/git-alias-for-git-log-and-git-oneline/</link>
      <pubDate>Sun, 01 Feb 2026 19:59:13 +0530</pubDate>
      <guid>https://gautamz07.github.io/peckingatcode-alpha/posts/git-alias-for-git-log-and-git-oneline/</guid>
